[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Shell Style Single Quotes
Comment=Taken from a real Bottles launcher. The Desktop Entry specification
Comment[x-note]=RESERVES the single quote, so the strict tokenizer treats it as a
Comment[x-note2]=literal character and splits 'EMU Stuff' into two broken arguments.
Comment[x-note3]=The pattern is recognisable, so parsing retries with the
Comment[x-note4]=compatibility tokenizer and the entry is marked nonstandard_exec
Comment[x-note5]=with exec_parse_mode="compat". See CHECKLIST.md DEV-8.
Exec=flatpak run --command=bottles-cli com.usebottles.bottles run -p EzRO -b 'EMU Stuff' -- %u
Icon=single-quote
Terminal=false
